###  http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/ont/dul/DUL.owl#Theory
<http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/ont/dul/DUL.owl#Theory> rdfs:comment "Perception is not necessarly actual crime; there is a close correspondence between perceived and actual crime, but a study reports substantial variation in perceptions of neighborhood crime controlling for official measures of crime rates; perceptions of crime more strongly predict the intention to move out of a neighborhood than do official crime rate measures. The perception of crime can depend on neighborhood racial composition."@en .


